1	### Task 7: Recruiter Job List page
2	
3	**Files:**
4	- Create: `pan-african-org/en/recruiter-jobs.html`
5	- Test: `tests/org-content.test.js`
6	
7	**Interfaces:**
8	- Produces: `recruiter-jobs.html`. Task 11 embeds its markup as video beat 03.
9	
10	Modelled on the entity-admin job-list overview, observed logged in on 2026-08-20.
11	
12	- [ ] **Step 1: Write the failing test**
13	
14	Append to `tests/org-content.test.js`:
15	
16	```js
17	test('recruiter page renders the entity-admin shell', () => {
18	  const html = read('recruiter-jobs.html');
19	  assert.ok(html.includes('Entity Admin'), 'missing entity-admin label');
20	  for (const item of ['Manage Entity', 'Users &amp; Roles', 'Jobs']) {
21	    assert.ok(html.includes(item), `recruiter nav missing "${item}"`);
22	  }
23	});
24	
25	test('recruiter page renders status tabs with counts', () => {
26	  const html = read('recruiter-jobs.html');
27	  for (const tab of ['Overview', 'Active', 'Draft', 'Closed', 'Expired', 'Trash', 'All']) {
28	    assert.ok(html.includes(tab), `missing status tab "${tab}"`);
29	  }
30	  assert.ok(/\(\d+\)/.test(html), 'status tabs must carry counts');
31	});
32	
33	test('recruiter page renders the four KPI tiles', () => {
34	  const html = read('recruiter-jobs.html');
35	  for (const kpi of [
36	    'Active Jobs', 'Applicants Awaiting Review',
37	    'Upcoming Pre-Screening Calls', 'Interview Responses Awaiting Review'
38	  ]) {
39	    assert.ok(html.toLowerCase().includes(kpi.toLowerCase()), `missing KPI "${kpi}"`);
40	  }
41	});
42	
43	test('recruiter page renders both charts with recruitment stages', () => {
44	  const html = read('recruiter-jobs.html');
45	  assert.ok(html.includes('Job Applications') || html.includes('JOB APPLICATIONS'));
46	  assert.ok(html.includes('Applicants by Recruitment Stage') ||
47	            html.includes('APPLICANTS BY RECRUITMENT STAGES'));
48	  for (const stage of ['Applied', 'Interview', 'Offer', 'Rejected']) {
49	    assert.ok(html.includes(stage), `missing stage "${stage}"`);
50	  }
51	});
52	
53	test('recruiter jobs table has the right columns and no misspelling', () => {
54	  const html = read('recruiter-jobs.html');
55	  for (const col of ['Title', 'Posted By', 'Posted On', 'Expires On',
56	                     'Sponsored Status', 'Applicants', 'Actions']) {
57	    assert.ok(html.includes(col), `jobs table missing column "${col}"`);
58	  }
59	  assert.ok(!/SPONORED/i.test(html), 'the live demo misspelling must not be reproduced');
60	});
61	
62	test('recruiter page offers Post a Job', () => {
63	  assert.ok(read('recruiter-jobs.html').includes('Post a Job'));
64	});
65	```
66	
67	- [ ] **Step 2: Run test to verify it fails**
68	
69	Run: `node --test tests/org-content.test.js`
70	Expected: FAIL — `ENOENT ... recruiter-jobs.html`.
71	
72	- [ ] **Step 3: Build the page**
73	
74	Create `pan-african-org/en/recruiter-jobs.html`, reusing the same `<head>` block. Structure:
75	
76	- **Left nav:** member-company name + `Entity Admin` subtitle · Home, Inbox, Manage Entity, Users & Roles, Jobs *(active)*
77	- **Header row:** "Overview" heading + **Post a Job** primary button
78	- **Status tabs with counts:** `Overview(6)`, `Active(4)`, `Draft(1)`, `Closed(1)`, `Expired(0)`, `Trash(0)`, `All(6)` — counts must sum consistently
79	- **Four KPI tiles:** Active Jobs, Applicants Awaiting Review, Upcoming Pre-Screening Calls, Interview Responses Awaiting Review — use non-zero values so the demo looks alive, unlike the live UAT entity
80	- **Two chart panels:**
81	  - *Job Applications* with range chips `24H / 7D / 30D / 90D / 365D` and a bar series
82	  - *Applicants by Recruitment Stage* with range chips `Today / This Week / This Month / This Year / All Time` and a legend of Applied / Interview / Offer / Rejected
83	  - Render bars as styled `div`s (the ministry pages already use this technique) — no charting library
84	- **Jobs table:** Title, Posted By, Posted On, Expires On, Sponsored Status, Applicants, Actions — at least 5 rows drawn from the Task 5 dataset
85	- **Language toggle** in the top bar, matching the seeker shell
86	
